     ],
     "text": "Morphology — see comparison tables"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      320.4,
      69.6,
      531.36,
      78.48
     ],
     "text": "‘Coco’ (Korferse) is a medium red glasshouse rose of"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      320.64,
      79.68,
      535.68,
      89.04
     ],
     "text": "upright to bushy habit with flowers approximately the"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      319.92,
      90.24,
      522.72,
      97.44
     ],
     "text": "same size as ‘Kardinal’ and ‘Toscana’. Flowers are"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      319.92,
      100.08,
      526.08,
      108.48
     ],
     "text": "flattened convex in profile. Sepals have a moderate"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      320.4,
      109.92,
      553.44,
      117.6
     ],
     "text": "number of extensions. Seed vessels are small and funnel-"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      320.4,
      120.0,
      555.6,
      129.36
     ],
     "text": "shaped. Fragrance is absent. Foliage is medium-green and"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      320.64,
      130.8,
      442.08,
      139.2
     ],
     "text": "leaf upper surfaces are glossy."
    }
   ],
   "page": 1,
   "source": "tesseract-psm3",
   "text": "Morphology — see comparison tables\n‘Coco’ (Korferse) is a medium red glasshouse rose of\nupright to bushy habit with flowers approximately the\nsame size as ‘Kardinal’ and ‘Toscana’. Flowers are\nflattened convex in profile. Sepals have a moderate\nnumber of extensions. Seed vessels are small and funnel-\nshaped. Fragrance is absent. Foliage is medium-green and\nleaf upper surfaces are glossy.",
   "text_format": "plain",
   "type": "text",
   "signal": "layout:ovisocr3-layout",
   "confidence": null,
   "layout_category": "text"
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
