   "id": "e7",
   "lines": [
    {
     "bbox": [
      320.88,
      154.32,
      536.16,
      162.72
     ],
     "text": "‘Coco’ (Korferse) has purple anthocyanin in the young"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      320.4,
      163.92,
      552.72,
      172.08
     ],
     "text": "shoots whereas ‘Toscana’ has none. ‘Coco’ (Korferse) has"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      320.88,
      174.24,
      531.84,
      182.64
     ],
     "text": "no prickles on the pedicel while ‘Kardinal’ has some."
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      320.88,
      183.84,
      545.04,
      192.24
     ],
     "text": "‘Coco’ (Korferse) has no basal spot on the outside of the"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      320.4,
      193.92,
      537.84,
      202.32
     ],
     "text": "petals unlike ‘Kardinal’ and ‘Toscana’. The petiolule in"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      320.64,
      203.52,
      549.84,
      211.92
     ],
     "text": "‘Coco’ (Korferse) is shorter than those of either ‘Kardinal’"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      320.64,
      213.84,
      370.56,
      220.56
     ],
     "text": "or ‘Toscana’."
    }
   ],
   "page": 1,
   "source": "tesseract-psm3",
   "text": "‘Coco’ (Korferse) has purple anthocyanin in the young\nshoots whereas ‘Toscana’ has none. ‘Coco’ (Korferse) has\nno prickles on the pedicel while ‘Kardinal’ has some.\n‘Coco’ (Korferse) has no basal spot on the outside of the\npetals unlike ‘Kardinal’ and ‘Toscana’. The petiolule in\n‘Coco’ (Korferse) is shorter than those of either ‘Kardinal’\nor ‘Toscana’.",
   "text_format": "plain",
   "type": "text",
